  "name": "piday-automata",
  "description": "A Python-based simulation framework for cellular automata, leveraging Pygame for real-time visualization on Raspberry Pi hardware. It provides modular implementations for Conway's Game of Life and a stochastic forest fire model, incorporating sprite-based animations for tree growth and combustion cycles. The project demonstrates grid-based state management, Moore neighborhood analysis, and interactive event-driven simulation control.",
